{%- comment -%}
  Doolittle Scuba: every product mockup on one uniform dark background (#0C1829, the website's dark navy),
  wherever the shop shows a product image: product page gallery and zoom, collection and search cards,
  the collection deck, the cart page and drawer. The Printful mockups are transparent, so this colour is
  what shows around the shirt. (Eric, 21 Nov 2026: "All mockup images should be on uniform backgrounds dark.")
  Loaded once in <head> from snippets/view-transition-opt-in.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% style %}
  :root { --ds-mock: #0C1829; }
  .card-gallery,
  .card-gallery img,
  .product-media-container,
  .product-media,
  .product-media img,
  .cart-items__media-container,
  .cart-items__media,
  .dsd .dk-face,
  .dsd .dk-pic {
    background: var(--ds-mock);
  }
{% endstyle %}
